### Create vendor
POST http://localhost:8080/api/vendors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ABC Services",
  "contactEmail": "vendor@example.com",
  "contactPhone": "+91 9876543210",
  "notes": "Primary maintenance vendor"
}

### List vendors
GET http://localhost:8080/api/vendors

### Create contract
POST http://localhost:8080/api/contracts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vendorId": 1,
  "serviceName": "Annual equipment maintenance",
  "contractStartDate": "2026-01-01",
  "endDate": "2026-12-31",
  "renewalNoticePeriodDays": 60,
  "contactEmail": "vendor@example.com",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "notes": "Review pricing before renewal"
}

### List contracts
GET http://localhost:8080/api/contracts

### Contracts expiring in next 30 days
GET http://localhost:8080/api/contracts/expiring?days=30

### Contracts currently in renewal review
GET http://localhost:8080/api/contracts/renewal-review

### Dashboard
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard

### Renewal decision - renewed
POST http://localhost:8080/api/contracts/1/renewal-decision
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "RENEWED",
  "newEndDate": "2027-12-31",
  "notes": "Renewed after annual review"
}

### Renewal decision - terminated
POST http://localhost:8080/api/contracts/1/renewal-decision
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "TERMINATED",
  "newEndDate": null,
  "notes": "Service no longer required"
}

### Renewal decision history
GET http://localhost:8080/api/contracts/1/renewal-decisions

### Add document reference
POST http://localhost:8080/api/contracts/1/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Signed Agreement",
  "referenceUrl": "https://example.com/contracts/agreement.pdf",
  "description": "Signed contract reference"
}

### List document references
GET http://localhost:8080/api/contracts/1/documents
